msgstr "PHP  so或 open缺失;不能ry化监督办的 key。"

msgid "Keys are encrypted with the WordPress salts. If the wp-config.php salts change, enter the POS keys again."
msgstr "关键与《京都议定书》 WordPress 盐类:如果conf类盐类的改变,则再次进入临时安全条约的关键。"

